Edit photos, retouch images and create digital artwork

GIMP is a full-featured image editor for photographers, illustrators and designers. It handles everything from quick crops and colour fixes to detailed retouching, painting and compositing with layers.

- Layers, masks, channels and non-destructive filters
- Selection, paths and retouching tools such as healing and cloning
- Painting with brushes, pressure-sensitive tablets and dynamics
- Opens and saves PSD, PNG, JPEG, WebP, TIFF, PDF and many more formats
- Extend it with plug-ins and scripts
